{"id":"asi_","lemma":"así","pos":"adv","rank":44,"glosses":["like this; like that; as such; thus; so; thereby; this way, that way","used to express wishes of misfortune against someone, or to cast a spell"],"ipa":"/aˈsi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-as%C3%AD.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siempre sucede así.","en":"It always happens this way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606558","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"},null]},{"text":"¿Así es cómo funciona?","en":"Is this how it works?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454232","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"}]},{"text":"Solía ser así.","en":"I used to be like that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850419","words":[{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Siempre lo hemos hecho así.","en":"We've always done it this way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152473","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"heme","l":"hemo"},{"g":"done, completed"},null]},{"text":"Jamás he visto algo así.","en":"I've never seen anything like this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798383","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"something, anything"},null]}]}